pan begin="00:35.512" end="00:36.130">know </span><span begin="00:36.130" end="00:36.486">it's </span><span begin="00:36.486" end="00:37.102">just </span><span begin="00:37.102" end="00:37.723">no </span><span begin="00:37.723" end="00:38.940">use</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.237" end="00:53.477"><span begin="00:40.237" end="00:40.861">When </span><span begin="00:40.861" end="00:41.378">all </span><span begin="00:41.378" end="00:41.701">your </span><span begin="00:41.701" end="00:43.057">lies </span><span begin="00:43.057" end="00:43.734">become </span><span begin="00:43.734" end="00:44.385">your </span><span begin="00:44.385" end="00:45.164">truths </span><span begin="00:45.164" end="00:45.800">and </span><span begin="00:45.800" end="00:47.039">I </span><span begin="00:47.039" end="00:48.475">don't </span><span begin="00:48.475" end="00:51.054">care </span><span begin="00:51.054" end="00:53.476">yeah </span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.318" end="00:57.545"><span begin="00:53.318" end="00:53.991">Could </span><span begin="00:53.991" end="00:54.241">you </span><span begin="00:54.241" end="00:54.504">look </span><span begin="00:54.504" end="00:54.792">me </span><span begin="00:54.792" end="00:55.108">in </span><span begin="00:55.108" end="00:55.418">the </span><span begin="00:55.418" end="00:57.545">eye</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.350" end="01:01.923"><span begin="00:57.350" end="00:57.868">And </span><span begin="00:57.868" end="00:58.581">tell </span><span begin="00:58.581" end="00:58.840">me </span><span begin="00:58.840" end="00:59.111">that </span><span begin="00:59.111" end="00:59.454">you're </span><span begin="00:59.454" end="01:00.113">happy </span><span begin="01:00.113" end="01:01.920">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.960" end="01:07.127"><span begin="01:03.960" end="01:04.444">Would </span><span begin="01:04.444" end="01:04.796">you </span><span begin="01:04.796" end="01:05.124">tell </span><span begin="01:05.124" end="01:05.426">it </span><span begin="01:05.426" end="01:05.687">to </span><span begin="01:05.687" end="01:06.071">my </span><span begin="01:06.071" end="01:07.118">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.827" end="01:09.381"><span begin="01:06.827" end="01:07.803">Have </span><span begin="01:07.803" end="01:08.110">I </span><span begin="01:08.110" end="01:08.486">been </span><span begin="01:08.486" end="01:09.380">erased</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.081" end="01:12.381"><span begin="01:09.081" end="01:09.620">Are </span><span begin="01:09.620" end="01:09.875">you </span><span begin="01:09.875" end="01:10.750">happy </span><span begin="01:10.750" end="01:12.374">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.502" end="01:16.195"><span begin="01:14.502" end="01:14.985">Are </span><span begin="01:14.985" end="01:15.214">you </span><span begin="01:15.214" end="01:15.901">happy </span><span begin="01:15.901" end="01:16.195">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.059" end="01:24.471"><span begin="01:18.059" end="01:20.661">You </span><span begin="01:20.661" end="01:21.006">took </span><span begin="01:21.006" end="01:21.721">all </span><span begin="01:21.721" end="01:22.037">there </span><span begin="01:22.037" end="01:22.471">was </span><span begin="01:22.471" end="01:23.113">to </span><span begin="01:23.113" end="01:24.470">take</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.643" end="01:30.547"><span begin="01:25.643" end="01:26.504">And </span><span begin="01:26.504" end="01:26.879">left </span><span begin="01:26.879" end="01:27.302">me </span><span begin="01:27.302" end="01:27.865">with </span><span begin="01:27.865" end="01:28.433">an </span><span begin="01:28.433" end="01:29.815">empty </span><span begin="01:29.815" end="01:30.542">plate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.247" end="01:35.678"><span begin="01:30.247" end="01:31.192">And </span><span begin="01:31.192" end="01:31.814">you </span><span begin="01:31.814" end="01:32.625">don't </s